gforest:S7c18+, e = 1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wGforestS7c18pHX` and `wGforestS7c18pGX` (divided by
`2 ^ 16` and `2 ^ 5`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per column;
the parts evaluate no word image. -/

